# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file, `COPY frontend/ ./` in the Dockerfile copies the host's node_modules into the
# image on top of the ones just installed — landing darwin-arm64 binaries (rollup, esbuild) in a
# linux image and inflating the build context by hundreds of megabytes.

# Dependencies and build output — reinstalled and rebuilt inside the image
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Go build artifacts
nexwiki
coverage.out

# The wiki's own content: a data volume at runtime, never baked into the image
my-wiki-data/

# VCS and local tooling
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log

# Docs and review notes have no bearing on the build
*.md
!README.md
images/
